                                "sense_id": "824165cc-f7db-3b48-a6e8-73c31f7d0526",
                                "text": "By the time the blue dress was tried on, Madame Cie had, with the aid of a few pins, plaits, and a bow of blue ribbon, transformed the half-lace shawl into one of the smartest and distingué things imaginable; but when the bill came in at Christmas, for that five minutes' labor and distingué touch, she charged one pound eight."
                            },
                            {
